            "review_title": "Review at City Garden Cafe",
            "review_text": "WMike77\n366 contributions\n0\nBig & colorful cafe garden to relax\nNov 2018 • Family\nSome may say: too much overload for a cafe, but it's really a funny place to enjoy your coffee/ice/drinks. Kids & women seem to go crazy and take many pictures there.\n\nFor ex. Waterfall and nice light strings in the eve/night.\n\nOnly their \"cocktails\" soso, because mostly based on a syrup combined with alcohol; a good bartender could give here more flavours to the customers to enjoy more.\n\nNice service team.\nRead more\nWritten November 26, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
