            "review_title": "Review at City Garden Cafe",
            "review_text": "David R\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam105 contributions\n0\nUnique Restaurant-Coffee Place Dutch Amsterdam Themed Design\nNov 2017 • Friends\nThis is a standout venue for casual dining, drinking and socializing day and night.\nThis is a fairly new addition to the thousands of coffee and drinking places in Ho Chi Minh City. This has been uniquely designed with both open, under cover and some indoor eating and drinking with many spaces of different ambience for different users from small to large groups. A relaxing environment with an Amsterdam theme for the facades and decks style overlooking a central void with waterfall and water features. An enjoyable place to retreat from the hectic city outside. An oasis in the desert so to speak. Many photo taking opportunities. Good service from staff.Visited during the day but would be very nice at nightime and special lighting.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 9, 2017",
